                    <ref target="frus1915Supp#pg_175">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1915, Supplement, p.
                        175</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d703-f2" n="2" xml:id="d703-f2-content">
                <p>A similar list was received from the Consul General at Paris, Jan. 3 (File No.
                    763.72112/3275).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
